{'symbol': 'NDSN', 'date': '2023-01-31 14:37:00', 'title': 'NORDSON CORPORATION AND NORDSON CORPORATION FOUNDATION GIVE NEARLY $13 MILLION TO CHARITY IN FISCAL YEAR 2022', 'text': 'WESTLAKE, OHIO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--NORDSON CORPORATION (NASDAQ: NDSN) AND THE NORDSON CORPORATION FOUNDATION TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THEY HAVE CONTRIBUTED APPROXIMATELY $13 MILLION TO CHARITY DURING THE 2022 FISCAL YEAR, WHICH ENDED OCTOBER 31, 2022.'}